   "en": "§ The mishna states that «one may not whiten tiles» by heating them, in order to roast food on them. The Gemara asks: «What does one» thereby «do;» since his intention is to prepare food, how does this differ from any other manner of roasting? «Rabba bar bar Ḥana said» that «Rabbi Yoḥanan said: Here we are dealing with new tiles,» and it is prohibited «because»"
